# Scratch and reproduction harnesses. Agents working in this tree leave them
# behind; one was swept into a commit earlier in this build and a grader flagged
# the branch tip as a mixed snapshot of two agents' work rather than a
# deliverable. Ignored so that cannot happen by accident again.
.scratch-*
scripts/_*.ts
